stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observe
    Observe --> Intent: eligible Missing or exact Legacy
    Observe --> Notice: ineligible
    Intent --> Recheck: durable intent
    Recheck --> UnlinkCanonical: fresh fence and authority
    UnlinkCanonical --> UnlinkLegacy
    UnlinkLegacy --> ReceiptCommit
    ReceiptCommit --> OutboxCommit
    OutboxCommit --> Wake
    Wake --> Admission
    Admission --> Wait: before plus Legacy
    Wait --> Wait
    Admission --> Grant: typed fresh Legacy proof
    Admission --> Ack: already settled outbox
    Grant --> Create
    Create --> Prompt
    Prompt --> Ack
    Intent --> Continuation: transient I/O error
    UnlinkLegacy --> Continuation: partial unlink
    ReceiptCommit --> Continuation: commit I/O error
    Boot --> Recover: discovered intent, controller acquired
    Recover --> Continuation: boot reobserve error
    Continuation --> Observe: live controller, no intent yet
    Continuation --> Recover: live controller, failures below 3
    Continuation --> Stuck: controller dropped mutant
    Stuck --> Stuck
    Recover --> UnlinkCanonical: fresh recheck, same paths
    Continuation --> Notice: budget exhausted
    Notice --> Ack: preserve custody, explicit notice
    Ack --> [*]
    note right of Continuation
      The same awaited callback continues.
      No new timer, wake or input is assumed.
    end note
    note right of Prompt
      Post-effect crash and replay are outside
      this retry liveness proof.
    end note
